---
// El Inframundo — Numbered cenote section with gradient overlay
---

<section id="cenotes" class="section el-inframundo">
  <div class="inframundo-image-wrapper">
    <img
      src="/cenoteSubterraneo.jpg"
      alt="Cenote Subterráneo"
      class="inframundo-bg-img"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="inframundo-image-overlay"></div>

    <!-- Number + Title over the image -->
    <div class="inframundo-image-text">
      <span class="inframundo-number">02</span>
      <h2 class="inframundo-title inframundo-animate">El Inframundo Maya</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Description and stats below the image -->
  <div class="inframundo-details">
    <div class="inframundo-details-inner">
      <p class="inframundo-desc inframundo-animate">
        Sumérgete al inframundo en nuestros dos hermosos cenotes, el primero es un cenote subterráneo tipo cueva y el segundo y más nuevo es nuestro cenote abierto al aire libre. Cada uno es único y con aguas cristalinas, ideales para refrescarse.
      </p>
      <div class="inframundo-nota inframundo-animate">
        <p class="inframundo-nota-text">
          <strong>Nota:</strong> 1 hora máximo por cenote y no se permite el uso de repelentes y bloqueadores solares para cuidar el agua.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="inframundo-precios inframundo-animate">
        <p class="inframundo-precios-dias">Abrimos todos los días</p>
        <div class="inframundo-precios-valores">
          <span class="inframundo-precios-item"><strong>$280</strong> adultos</span>
          <span class="inframundo-precios-item"><strong>$230</strong> niños</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  // @ts-nocheck
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const items = document.querySelectorAll('.inframundo-animate');
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
          observer.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.3 });
    items.forEach((item) => observer.observe(item));

    // Parallax on the image
    const img = document.querySelector('.inframundo-bg-img');
    if (!img) return;
    let ticking = false;
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      if (!ticking) {
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          const rect = img.closest('.el-inframundo').getBoundingClientRect();
          if (rect.top < window.innerHeight && rect.bottom > 0) {
            const progress = -rect.top / window.innerHeight;
            img.style.transform = `translateY(${progress * 290}px) scale(1.05)`;
          }
          ticking = false;
        });
        ticking = true;
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .el-inframundo {
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* ─── Image area ─── */
  .inframundo-image-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 70vh;
    min-height: 500px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .inframundo-bg-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 120%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    transform: scale(1.05);
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .inframundo-image-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(13, 11, 8, 0.85) 0%, transparent 60%);
  }

  .inframundo-image-text {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
    left: clamp(24px, 5vw, 80px);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .inframundo-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .inframundo-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-variant: small-caps;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 76px);
    color: var(--color-limestone);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  /* ─── Details below image ─── */
  .inframundo-details {
    background: var(--color-obsidian);
    padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px) 0;
  }

  .inframundo-details-inner {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(24px, 5vw, 80px);
  }

  .inframundo-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 19px);
    color: var(--color-limestone);
    opacity: 0.8;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .inframundo-nota {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .inframundo-nota-text {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.4vw, 16px);
    color: var(--color-limestone);
    opacity: 0.75;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold);
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.06);
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
  }

  .inframundo-nota-text strong {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .inframundo-precios {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.25);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.04);
  }

  .inframundo-precios-dias {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .inframundo-precios-valores {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .inframundo-precios-item {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-limestone);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .inframundo-precios-item strong {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    font-weight: 700;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* ─── Entrance animations ─── */
  .inframundo-animate {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(40px);
    transition: opacity 0.9s var(--ease-out-expo), transform 0.9s var(--ease-out-expo);
  }

  .inframundo-animate.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .inframundo-animate:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 0.15s; }
  .inframundo-animate:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
</style>
